      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The man proceeded forward into the cave.

    He knew deep down that his fears would consume on this more dangerous pathway towards Barnaby''s picnic, however the man knew one thing that could keep him going no matter what.

    "I do?"

    Bravery is the idea of being afraid of something, but proceeding forward with it anyways.'
